      "OriginalText": "Tch-ch-ch, ah... Three, two, one...",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 2,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 18.5,
      "EndSecond": 21.1,
      "OriginalText": "'You're the only one, you're the only one,' yeah, she sang that too but",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 3,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 21.2,
      "EndSecond": 24.1,
      "OriginalText": "It's not like I can actually find you anywhere",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 4,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 24.2,
      "EndSecond": 26.4,
      "OriginalText": "I'm just done with people, I'm in this cold inorganic phase",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 5,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 26.6,
      "EndSecond": 28.2,
      "OriginalText": "If you think inviting someone out for food is easy then you can screw off!",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 6,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 28.4,
      "EndSecond": 30.3,
      "OriginalText": "I'm eating alone 365 days a year, end of story",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 7,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 30.4,
      "EndSecond": 32.2,
      "OriginalText": "Not going home! Not seeing my parents!",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 8,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 32.3,
      "EndSecond": 34.8,
      "OriginalText": "I'm comfortable and it's my life, who cares how neglected my heart is",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 9,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 35,
      "EndSecond": 37.4,
      "OriginalText": "Sometimes I wonder if something nice won't happen for once",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 10,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 37.4,
      "EndSecond": 38.8,
      "OriginalText": "A movie meet-cute type thing, right?",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 11,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 38.9,
      "EndSecond": 39.8,
      "OriginalText": "You know, like where are you?",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 12,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 40,
      "EndSecond": 43,
      "OriginalText": "Be with me! Come and find me! I'm right here",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 13,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 43.4,
      "EndSecond": 45.5,
      "OriginalText": "One hundred years of solitude I've been waiting here for you",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 14,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 45.6,
      "EndSecond": 46.9,
      "OriginalText": "I'll propose to you!",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 15,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 47.5,
      "EndSecond": 50.3,
      "OriginalText": "On a beautiful flowering hill floating alone in space",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 16,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 51.2,
      "EndSecond": 54.7,
      "OriginalText": "I work my ass right off like I've got nothing else",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 17,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 55.4,
      "EndSecond": 63,
      "OriginalText": "For lunch I've got a special homemade bento box",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 18,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 63.4,
      "EndSecond": 66.5,
      "OriginalText": "And that's a win for me!",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 19,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 67.4,
      "EndSecond": 71.5,
      "OriginalText": "I went through every day like I was living dead",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 20,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 71.7,
      "EndSecond": 75.6,
      "OriginalText": "An everyday so sparkling with radiance",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 21,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 75.6,
      "EndSecond": 81.2,
      "OriginalText": "And all of it was 'cause I got to meet you, so you know",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 22,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 81.8,
      "EndSecond": 85.7,
      "OriginalText": "I got to meet you",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 23,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 85.8,
      "EndSecond": 89.9,
      "OriginalText": "I met you, didn't I?",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 24,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 90,
      "EndSecond": 94.3,
      "OriginalText": "Or did I meet you?",
      "Text": "",
      "Style": {}
    },
    {
      "Index": 25,
      "Enabled": true,
      "StartSecond": 94.4,
      "EndSecond": 102.6,
      "OriginalText": "I guess I just thought I got to meet you",
